  "item_short_desc": "<p>Show your solidarity and support for those serving with our Athletic Fit R.E.D. (Remember Everyone Deployed) T-Shirt. The front graphic design on the front that honors service members and military personnel, along with a distressed American Flag on the right sleeve. The athletic fit features a smaller chest, armholes, and sleeve openings for a sleek, sporty look. Made from super soft 60% cotton / 40% polyester ring-spun material, these graphic tee offer long-lasting comfort.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "132775",
  "description": "<p>Show your solidarity and support for those serving with our Athletic Fit R.E.D. (Remember Everyone Deployed) T-Shirt. The front graphic design on the front that honors service members and military personnel, along with a distressed American Flag on the right sleeve. The athletic fit features a smaller chest, armholes, and sleeve openings for a sleek, sporty look. Made from super soft 60% cotton / 40% polyester ring-spun material, these graphic tee offer long-lasting comfort. The tag-less neck label enhances comfort, ensuring a smooth feel against your skin. Whether you&rsquo;re out hiking on a trail, spending a day at the beach, or casually walking around town, our Remember Everyone Deployed T-Shirts are great for weekend adventures, working-out, everyday use, and more. They&rsquo;re also perfect for showcasing your American spirit during 4th of July, Memorial Day, Veterans Day, and Red Fridays.</p>",
